  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest Governance, Markets and Climate Phase 2 - Multi-stakeholder Forestry Programme 5</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MFP5 (Multistakeholder Forestry Programme Phase 5) will support Indonesia in achieving its climate mitigation targets by promoting sustainable forest management and strengthening forest governance. The programme focuses on inclusive, multistakeholder processes that enhance the stewardship of forest resources while contributing to poverty alleviation and biodiversity conservation.</narrative>
